      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxkactlrhc2a",
      "text": "Tries from Hugo Keenan, Jack Conan and a Jimmy O'Brien double have us in front at the break with a bonus point already in the bag ⚡\nIt's been a productive first 40 minutes at Laya Arena! 🙌\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
