      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxjrlzej7s2q",
      "text": "Cardiff 35-12 Carmarthen FT\nThe slope and the wind work wonders for the Rags as they get clinical and earn the super duper bonus point.\nNot a classic performance but job done against a niggly opposition in tricky conditions.\n#BlueAndBlacks",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
