      "text": "Cardiff 7-7 Carmarthen HT\nA tense first half at a windy CAP with the Rags mostly camped in our own 22, but now looking to open up playing with the wind and slope.\n#BlueAndBlacks",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
