      "publishedAt": "2026-10-09T21:45:38.238Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:7azxdiemtvd7otuvlaeddz7p/bafkreif6wa7n25b5itppt7brbpn4cxahkmpg36itgw2fp7hx4q2647kmja",
      "source": "connachtrugbai.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxhsvjskas2k",
      "text": "A bit like Al Pacino's Frank Slade in Scent Of A Woman, we're only getting warmed up on The Leinster Playbook.\nFor €5 a week we offer sustained long reads, coupled with news, interviews and original features.\ntheleinsterplaybook.counterpress.media",
      "author": "The Leinster Playbook",
      "handle": "lplaybook.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/bafkreigindvb7f6skkn3rjvjebp3pnkmcq2chdzvfyslpzqvymmoex2w5e",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lplaybook.bsky.social/post/3mxhsvjskas2k",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-09T20:30:10.538Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/bafkreih5njrphrhpbq632bnbyyumnvetvuj3zvvgd63eapo7nb5gaabt7y",
      "source": "lplaybook.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:7azxdiemtvd7otuvlaeddz7p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxhs3hxgoz2r",
      "text": "Work to do after the break.\n@KiaRenmore | #MovementThatInspires",
      "author": "Connacht Rugby",
      "handle": "connachtrugbai.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:7azxdiemtvd7otuvlaeddz7p/bafkreidpaf4huzx5eselthu4md6z46ho6zni46nu3gflikegpybr4rysgu",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/connachtrugbai.bsky.social/post/3mxhs3hxgoz2r",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-09T20:15:35.883Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:7azxdiemtvd7otuvlaeddz7p/bafkreibko4wz3gljek7i7dxvuosunipr3yiywschujy7o73lk46tca7asm",
      "source": "connachtrugbai.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:7azxdiemtvd7otuvlaeddz7p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxhplg6fpr2j",
      "text": "The physicality in this is off the charts 😤\nReminder you can get regular updates on the official Connacht Rugby app 📱\n#GLAvCON | #BKTURC",
      "author": "Connacht Rugby",
      "handle": "connachtrugbai.bsky.social",
